This covers the contents of this repository only.

The OMG specification materials that tools/fetch-references retrieves — the
SysML v2 and KerML specification documents, the standard model library, the
metamodel and vocabulary files, and the SysML v2 Pilot Implementation — are NOT
part of this repository, are not distributed with it, and carry their own terms
from the Object Management Group. Fetching them is your action, under those
terms.
